1
00:00:00,735 --> 00:00:02,975
(Leonard:)-I am. I'm really proud.
-Yeah.

2
00:00:05,106 --> 00:00:07,056
(Amy(on webcam):)Hello, Sheldon.
Is everything okay?

3
00:00:07,075 --> 00:00:09,075
(Sheldon:)Yes. Why?

4
00:00:09,210 --> 00:00:11,660
(Amy:)Well, the last time you made
an unscheduled video chat,

5
00:00:11,746 --> 00:00:13,746
(Amy:)there was a curly fry
in your regular fries

6
00:00:13,815 --> 00:00:16,425
(Amy:)and you thought someone might be
trying to slip you a mickey.

7
00:00:18,453 --> 00:00:20,623
(Sheldon:)April 13...

8
00:00:20,722 --> 00:00:22,562
(Sheldon:)A dark night, indeed.

9
00:00:24,125 --> 00:00:25,165
(Amy:)So what can I do for you?

10
00:00:25,259 --> 00:00:27,469
(Sheldon:)I'm calling to invite you

11
00:00:27,562 --> 00:00:30,012
(Sheldon:)to a spontaneous date night
tomorrow evening.

12
00:00:30,098 --> 00:00:32,438
(Penny:)-Really?
-Yes.

13
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,480
(Sheldon:)You were kind enough to watch
Raiders of the Lost Ark with me.

14
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:39,810
(Sheldon:)So I'd like to return the favour
by inviting you to watch an episode

15
00:00:39,907 --> 00:00:42,907
(Sheldon:)of your favourite childhood
television series,

16
00:00:42,977 --> 00:00:45,087
(Sheldon:)Little House on the Prairie.

17
00:00:46,681 --> 00:00:48,661
(Amy:)That sounds lovely.

18
00:00:49,317 --> 00:00:51,097
(Amy:)Why are you rubbing your hands
together?

19
00:00:53,855 --> 00:00:55,265
(CLEARS THROAT)

20
00:00:55,590 --> 00:00:58,130
(Sheldon:)I'm putting on lotion.
Are you in or not?

21
00:00:58,259 --> 00:00:59,799
(Amy:)Of course I'm in.

22
00:00:59,861 --> 00:01:02,671
(Sheldon:)Excellent.
Then I shall see you tomorrow.

